# uv
uv.lock.bak

# Local prep notes / scratch docs — intentionally NOT committed.
# NOTE: this must be `docs/*`, not `docs/`. Git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a `!docs/plans/` negation cannot re-include anything
# under a plain `docs/` rule.
docs/*
# ...except the plan pipeline. `docs/requirements/` is the input (the ask, its
# non-goals and decisions); `docs/plans/` is what `/plan` writes and `/implement`
# and `/review` read back. Both are real project artifacts and belong in git.
!docs/requirements/
!docs/plans/

# Claude Code: share CLAUDE.md, .claude/settings.json and .claude/skills/;
# keep per-user local overrides out.
.claude/settings.local.json
